msgctxt "seo_title"
msgid "Join us: Apply, connect, and give"
msgstr "Únete a nosotros: presenta tu solicitud, conéctate y colabora"

msgctxt "search_description"
msgid "A better tech future is still ours to build. Join Mozilla Foundation by applying for funding, connecting with our community, or giving back."
msgstr "Todavía está en nuestras manos construir un futuro tecnológico mejor. Únete a la Fundación Mozilla solicitando financiación, conectando con nuestra comunidad o colaborando."

msgctxt "title"
msgid "Join us"
msgstr "Únete a nosotros"

msgctxt "hero_title"
msgid "A better tech future is still ours to build."
msgstr "Todavía está en nuestras manos construir un futuro tecnológico mejor."

msgctxt "hero_description"
msgid "It starts with people rethinking what technology can be. Join us to take your ideas further."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "body.bfc201a1-922c-4045-bec9-b9ee3a6343ff"
msgid "Funding opportunities"
msgstr "Oportunidades de financiación"

msgctxt "body.bfc201a1-922c-4045-bec9-b9ee3a6343ff"
msgid "Mozilla Foundation opens calls for applications and proposals throughout the year. Current calls are listed on this page."
msgstr "La Fundación Mozilla abre convocatorias de solicitudes y propuestas a lo largo del año. En esta página te mostramos las convocatorias actuales."

msgctxt "body.bfc201a1-922c-4045-bec9-b9ee3a6343ff"
msgid "Sign up for updates"
msgstr "Regístrate para recibir actualizaciones"

msgctxt "body.bfc201a1-922c-4045-bec9-b9ee3a6343ff"
msgid "to learn about new calls as they open."
msgstr "y enterarse de las nuevas convocatorias en cuanto se abran."

msgctxt "body.5fe7d5d5-6283-445d-9a27-25c6801c1e64.left_column.ced6741c-30cd-482e-9a49-9027545b92c1"
msgid "Human-Scale AI Incubator"
msgstr "Incubadora de IA a escala humana"

msgctxt "body.5fe7d5d5-6283-445d-9a27-25c6801c1e64.left_column.ced6741c-30cd-482e-9a49-9027545b92c1"
msgid "Mozilla Foundation is investing in an alternative trajectory for AI. We call it Human-Scale AI: bespoke, fit-for-purpose technology designed at the scale of the problem it’s meant to solve."
msgstr ""
"La Fundación Mozilla está invirtiendo en una trayectoria alternativa para la IA. La llamamos IA a escala humana: tecnología a medida, adecuada a un propósito y diseñada a la escala del problema que "
"pretende resolver."

msgctxt "body.5fe7d5d5-6283-445d-9a27-25c6801c1e64.left_column.ced6741c-30cd-482e-9a49-9027545b92c1"
msgid "We’ll fund seven projects with up to $500,000 each over three years. <b>Applications close Friday, November 20, 2026 at 11:59 PM Pacific (UTC-8).</b>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "body.5fe7d5d5-6283-445d-9a27-25c6801c1e64.right_column.652bb4d9-d404-4d00-a920-5bf272cd72cd.label"
msgid "Apply to the Incubator"
msgstr "Presenta tu solicitud para la incubadora"

msgctxt "body.09ed29e2-1d64-4c36-a26a-f98491e541b7.left_column.f799c6b8-e0a0-448b-bfb1-bc94cd406d84"
msgid "Fellowships"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "body.09ed29e2-1d64-4c36-a26a-f98491e541b7.left_column.f799c6b8-e0a0-448b-bfb1-bc94cd406d84"
msgid "Mozilla Foundation is backing extraordinary people at the edges of human imagination, working on technology that’s too early, too unexpected, or too ambitious for anyone else to fund."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "body.09ed29e2-1d64-4c36-a26a-f98491e541b7.left_column.f799c6b8-e0a0-448b-bfb1-bc94cd406d84"
msgid ""
"We’ll fund 10 Fellows with up to $125,000 each over 12 months, plus access to a global network of more than 200 Fellows. <b>Applications close Applications close Thursday, December 17, 2026 at 11:59"
" PM Pacific Standard Time (UTC-8).</b>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "body.09ed29e2-1d64-4c36-a26a-f98491e541b7.right_column.c553fed4-b8f0-4227-b868-4edef2649c2c.label"
msgid "Apply to Fellowships"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "body.638cb47c-36a3-4070-92d2-11b9c3cc2b8c"
msgid "Opportunities to connect"
msgstr "Oportunidades para conectar"

msgctxt "body.638cb47c-36a3-4070-92d2-11b9c3cc2b8c"
msgid ""
"Unexpected ideas come from unlikely connections. Mozilla Foundation brings together the builders, technologists, artists, makers and dreamers shaping better technology. Help good ideas travel by "
"exploring ways to connect."
msgstr ""
"Las ideas inesperadas surgen de conexiones insospechadas. La Fundación Mozilla reúne a desarrolladores, tecnólogos, artistas, creadores y soñadores que están dando forma a una tecnología mejor. "
"Ayuda a que las buenas ideas viajen explorando formas de conectar."

msgctxt "body.08f0fd11-c9a3-459c-867e-fff3b4d9a167.left_column.42b4d179-ab74-4bc8-9e45-2e96987af375"
msgid "2026 Mozilla Festival"
msgstr "Festival Mozilla 2026"

msgctxt "body.08f0fd11-c9a3-459c-867e-fff3b4d9a167.left_column.42b4d179-ab74-4bc8-9e45-2e96987af375"
msgid "Mozilla Festival, also known as MozFest, is three days of bold conversations, hands-on building, and ideas worth traveling for."
msgstr "El Festival Mozilla, también conocido como MozFest, consiste en tres días de audaces conversaciones, desarrollos e ideas por las que vale la pena viajar."

msgctxt "body.08f0fd11-c9a3-459c-867e-fff3b4d9a167.left_column.42b4d179-ab74-4bc8-9e45-2e96987af375"
msgid "This year, MozFest is taking over Barcelona's Recinte Fabra i Coats from Wednesday, October 28-30, 2026."
msgstr "Este año, el MozFest tendrá lugar en el Recinte Fabra i Coats de Barcelona, del miércoles 28 al 30 de octubre de 2026."

msgctxt "body.08f0fd11-c9a3-459c-867e-fff3b4d9a167.right_column.c9ebbcd9-a5b5-4822-aac2-7ad78e81587e.label"
msgid "Get Your Badge"
msgstr "Consigue tu insignia"

msgctxt "body.01ff76de-8e7a-43b3-99f5-9e0a31c79df7.left_column.2277e981-71a1-4431-9cd1-a67a27c2a4cc.image.alt_text"
msgid "Portrait of woman in Black Futurist shirt"
msgstr "Retrato de una mujer con una camiseta que dice Black Futurist"

msgctxt "body.01ff76de-8e7a-43b3-99f5-9e0a31c79df7.right_column.a1c537c0-1a98-4f06-b200-245eab07f3e0"
msgid "A better future for technology takes more than one person or one idea."
msgstr "Un futuro mejor para la tecnología requiere más que una sola persona o una sola idea."

msgctxt "body.01ff76de-8e7a-43b3-99f5-9e0a31c79df7.right_column.a1c537c0-1a98-4f06-b200-245eab07f3e0"
msgid "It takes a community. Follow Mozilla Foundation on"
msgstr "Hace falta una comunidad. Sigue a la Fundación Mozilla en"

msgctxt "body.01ff76de-8e7a-43b3-99f5-9e0a31c79df7.right_column.a1c537c0-1a98-4f06-b200-245eab07f3e0"
